#: 41bc7e2e67584febb5027e15d7f90068
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/clock.rst:2
msgid "时钟"
msgstr "Clock"

#: 7baf7b576960438aac89194001cc2422
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/clock.rst:17
msgid "如果想给某个外设配置一个时钟，需要调用哪些函数？"
msgstr ""
"If you want to configure a clock for a specific peripheral, which "
"functions need to be called?"

#: 44c945cd199d467db10b16c4fcff56ca
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/clock.rst:19
msgid ""
"``GLB_Set_System_CLK()`` --> 设置整个系统的时钟， 部分外设时钟也来源于此 "
"``GLB_Set_......_CLK()`` --> 设置目标外设时钟 ``GLB_AHB_Slave1_Clock_Gate()`` -->"
" 部分外设时钟默认被 gate， 使用该外设时需要主动ungate 其它外设 --> 目标外设内相关时钟配置"
msgstr ""
"``GLB_Set_System_CLK()`` --> Sets the clock for the entire system. Some peripheral clocks are also derived from it. ``GLB_Set_......_CLK()`` --> Sets the target peripheral clock. "
"``GLB_AHB_Slave1_Clock_Gate()`` --> Some peripheral clocks are gated by default and must be explicitly ungated. Other peripherals --> Configure the related clocks inside the target peripheral."

#: 002e04db3e53465dbbe20b6e8d554b60
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/clock.rst:24
msgid "PDS、HBN的工作机制是什么？如何实现唤醒？"
msgstr ""
"What are the operating mechanisms of PDS and HBN? How is wake-up "
"implemented?"

#: 1d4629de9f1644bd8ef89e5646d1756f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/clock.rst:26
msgid "将芯片划分为多个电源域，通过不同电源域掉电与否的组合来实现不同级别的低功耗模式，详情参见低RM功耗章节。 不同级别的低功耗模式唤醒源均不相同。"
msgstr ""
"The chip is divided into multiple power domains. Different levels of low-"
"power modes are implemented through combinations of whether different "
"power domains are powered down. For details, refer to the low-power "
"chapter of the RM. Wake-up sources vary for different levels of low-power"
" modes."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/clock.rst:30
#: f73347abec0f4d0fa0173d0453907779
msgid "芯片的功耗是多少？"
msgstr "What is the chip power consumption?"

#: 091e6e0ad6a840db90c0969d76fdee42
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/clock.rst:32
msgid "低负荷运行时电流在10mA左右，高负荷运行时电流40mA以上，低功耗模式最低可达2uA左右。"
msgstr ""
"The current is around 10 mA under low-load operation, over 40 mA under "
"high-load operation, and can be as low as around 2 μA in low-power mode."
